---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../../components/Navbar.astro';
import PageShell from '../../components/PageShell.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="Terms & Conditions | Real BMI"
    description="Review the official terms and conditions for using Real BMI, our free browser-based health calculators, educational reference tools, and wellness resources."
>
    <Navbar />
    <PageShell
        title="Terms & Conditions"
        eyebrow="Professional standards"
        description="Review the terms of use for Real BMI’s calculators, health tools, and privacy-forward experience."
        returnUrl="/en/"
        returnLabel="Home"
    >
        <div class="prose prose-zinc dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed space-y-10 text-lg md:text-xl font-medium opacity-85">
            <p>
                These Terms and Conditions govern your access to and use of <span class="text-[var(--foreground)] font-bold">Real BMI</span>, including all calculators, interactive charts, educational content, and software utilities accessible via our website. By accessing or using our platform, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree with any part of these provisions, you should refrain from using the site.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">1. Educational Scope & Non-Diagnostic Purpose</h2>
            <p>
                All calculators, assessment scores, and health reference models provided on Real BMI—including Body Mass Index (BMI), Basal Metabolic Rate (BMR), Total Daily Energy Expenditure (TDEE), and body composition calculators—are designed strictly for general educational and personal health awareness. Under no circumstances should calculations or metrics generated by this service be interpreted as medical diagnoses, individualized clinical assessments, or treatment prescriptions. Always seek the advice of a board-certified physician, registered dietitian, or qualified healthcare professional regarding any medical condition or dietary lifestyle change.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">2. Scientific Formulas & Calculation Accuracy</h2>
            <p>
                Real BMI implements scientifically recognized, peer-reviewed mathematical formulas, such as the World Health Organization (WHO) and Centers for Disease Control (CDC) body mass classifications, the Mifflin-St Jeor equation for basal metabolism, and established athletic strength equations. While we strive to ensure that all algorithms accurately reflect their underlying published literature, individual human biology varies significantly. Factors such as skeletal frame density, athletic muscular development, age-related sarcopenia, and ethnic fat distribution patterns can lead to discrepancies between statistical population models and an individual’s true metabolic state.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">3. Local Browser Processing & Data Privacy</h2>
            <p>
                We prioritize user privacy by design. All anthropometric parameters (such as height, weight, age, and sex) entered into our interactive calculators are computed entirely client-side within your local browser runtime. Real BMI does not transmit, store, sell, or log your personal health calculations to external databases or remote servers.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">4. Permitted Use & User Obligations</h2>
            <p>
                You are granted a revocable, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to access Real BMI for personal, non-commercial educational use. You agree not to engage in automated scraping, denial-of-service attacks, reverse engineering, or unauthorized distribution of site algorithms and assets without prior written consent.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">5. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>
            <p>
                All proprietary software code, visual layouts, typography systems, vector graphics, custom 3D WebGL meshes, and editorial analysis published on Real BMI are protected by international copyright, trademark, and intellectual property treaties. Reproduction, republication, or commercial exploitation without express written permission is strictly prohibited.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
            <p>
                Real BMI and its operators provide this platform on an "as-is" and "as-available" basis without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. In no event shall Real BMI, its contributors, or affiliates be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from the use or inability to use our tools, or from decisions made based on informational estimates provided on this site.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">7. Updates to Terms</h2>
            <p>
                We reserve the right to revise, amend, or update these Terms and Conditions at any time to reflect platform enhancements, operational changes, or legal compliance requirements. Continued use of Real BMI following the publication of revised terms constitutes your binding acceptance of the updated terms.
            </p>
        </div>
    </PageShell>
</Layout>
